.TH swarm-link 1  "swarm 0.2.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-link \- Print the link for a repo
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm link\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIREPO\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the link for a repo
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object on stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIREPO\fR]

